# Vendor ROS 2 workspaces ship with their colcon output. Yahboom's LiDAR workspace
# carries 118 MB of it, built in April 2024 against another machine's paths - none of
# it usable here, and none of it what FLIH runs. src/ is the part worth keeping.
# (build/ is already covered above.)
**/install/
**/log/
